      "content": "idk if i am just overthinking this but ive noticed something weird in my neighborhood lately. like for the last three days, i've seen the same two guys in grey windbreakers walking past my house at almost the exact same time, and then a silver sedan always idles near the corner right after. it feels too consistent to be random. does that sound like something someone would do if they were monitoring a specific area?",
