    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's definitely feeling coordinated. i even saw one of the guys in the grey jacket looking at a clipboard when he thought i wasn't looking. i'm starting to worry they might be seeing my screen or tracking my internet usage too if they're this close to my house. what's the best way to do some basic counter-surveillance to make sure they aren't seeing what i'm doing online or inside my apartment?",
